SUMMARY:Application deadline: ERC Starting Grant 2027
DESCRIPTION:ERC. For researchers post-PhD (eligibility widened to 10 years
  from 2027). Up to €1.5M for 5 years. Bottom-up: any research topic. Ca
 ll opens July 2026\, deadline 14 October 2026.\n\nhttps://erc.europa.eu/a
 pply-grant/starting-grant
URL:https://erc.europa.eu/apply-grant/starting-grant
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
