SUMMARY:Application deadline: Sustainability Education Community Fund (UU)
DESCRIPTION:Utrecht University – Pathways to Sustainability. Small grant
 s for bottom-up sustainability-education initiatives at UU such as worksh
 ops\, seminars and pilots\; covers assistance and material costs (incl. t
 ravel and events)\, not teaching-hour reductions. €12\,500 available in
  this round\; decisions 6–8 weeks after the deadline.\n\nhttps://www.uu
 .nl/en/research/sustainability/sustainability-education-and-engagement/fu
 nding
URL:https://www.uu.nl/en/research/sustainability/sustainability-education-
 and-engagement/funding
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
