DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261103
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261104
SUMMARY:Pre-proposal deadline: Exploration Call 2026-3
DESCRIPTION:KWF (Dutch Cancer Society). Fundamental research on underlying
  biological and psychosocial mechanisms of cancer onset\, growth\, spread
  and impact. Relevant for pharmacoepi research on anticancer drugs. 2026-
 3 round: pre-proposal stage opens 1 September 2026 and closes 3 November 
 2026 12:00\; invited full proposals open 15 February 2027.\n\nhttps://www
 .kwf.nl/en/forresearchers/funding/exploration
URL:https://www.kwf.nl/en/forresearchers/funding/exploration
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
