DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261103
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261104
SUMMARY:Full proposal deadline: International Joint Initiative 2026 – Di
 sruptive Technologies for Global Challenges
DESCRIPTION:NWO. €3.8M NWO budget\, max €760k per project for 3 years.
  LOI due 9 June 2026\, full proposals due 3 November 2026. Must harness d
 isruptive technologies to address Sustainable Development Goals. Requires
  interdisciplinary approach across ≥2 of: natural sciences/engineering\
 , social sciences/humanities\, health/life sciences. Relevant for AI/data
  science applications in drug safety and pharmacoepidemiology.\n\nhttps:/
 /www.nwo.nl/en/calls/2026-international-joint-initiative-for-research-har
 nessing-disruptive-technologies-to-address-global-challenges
URL:https://www.nwo.nl/en/calls/2026-international-joint-initiative-for-re
 search-harnessing-disruptive-technologies-to-address-global-challenges
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
