SUMMARY:Full proposal deadline: KIC Demand-driven Research by Consortia 
 – XL
DESCRIPTION:NWO. Large-scale consortia addressing societal challenges. Pre
 -proposals were due 10 March 2026. Full proposals due 12 November 2026. C
 o-funding from societal/industry partners required.\n\nhttps://www.nwo.nl
 /en/researchprogrammes/knowledge-and-innovation-covenant
URL:https://www.nwo.nl/en/researchprogrammes/knowledge-and-innovation-cove
 nant
