DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261113
SUMMARY:Pre-proposal deadline: Women's Cardiovascular Disease Consortium 2
 026
DESCRIPTION:Hartstichting (Dutch Heart Foundation). Hartstichting call to 
 form a new consortium for cardiovascular disease in women\, building on t
 he IMPRESS programme. €3M total\, ~€500k per project idea. Researcher
 s submit individual/small team project ideas\; selected ideas pitch on 12
  November 2026. Contact joost.leenders@hartstichting.nl beforehand. Relev
 ant for pharmacoepi research on sex differences in cardiovascular drug ou
 tcomes.\n\nhttps://professionals.hartstichting.nl/actualiteiten/call-op-w
 eg-naar-een-nieuw-consortium-voor-hart-en-vaatziekten-bij-vrouwen
URL:https://professionals.hartstichting.nl/actualiteiten/call-op-weg-naar-
 een-nieuw-consortium-voor-hart-en-vaatziekten-bij-vrouwen
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
