DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261125
SUMMARY:Application deadline: MSCA Doctoral Networks 2026
DESCRIPTION:European Commission – MSCA. OPEN (opened 28 May 2026). Fundi
 ng for innovative doctoral training networks. Supports 3-year PhD positio
 ns with international mobility. Deadline 24 November 2026. Budget €563M
 . The division already runs EU2P programme. New 2026-27 Work Programme in
 troduced simplifications.\n\nhttps://marie-sklodowska-curie-actions.ec.eu
 ropa.eu/actions/doctoral-networks
URL:https://marie-sklodowska-curie-actions.ec.europa.eu/actions/doctoral-n
 etworks
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
