DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261127
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261128
SUMMARY:Application deadline: Utrechts Universiteitsfonds – Funding for 
 researchers (round 6\, 2026)
DESCRIPTION:Utrechts Universiteitsfonds. Grants for UU employees for resea
 rch visits abroad and for research and education costs (e.g. hiring help\
 , materials\, organising a congress)\, applied for through the UU subsidy
  portal. Six rounds per year\; not every fund type is open in every round
 \, and each fund has its own criteria.\n\nhttps://www.uu.nl/en/organisati
 on/donate/apply-for-subsidies/funding-for-researchers
URL:https://www.uu.nl/en/organisation/donate/apply-for-subsidies/funding-f
 or-researchers
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
