DTSTAMP:20261009T132154Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261211
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261212
SUMMARY:Next cut-off deadline: Open Technology Programme (OTP) 2026
DESCRIPTION:NWO. €25.9M budget for free\, unrestricted applied and techn
 ical-scientific research. Continuous submission 12 Jan – 11 Dec 2026. A
 ssessment: 50% scientific quality\, 50% impact. Companies and societal or
 ganisations can participate. Good fit for data-driven pharmacoepi tools\,
  digital health tech\, and AI applications in drug safety.\n\nhttps://www
 .nwo.nl/en/calls/open-technology-programme-2026
URL:https://www.nwo.nl/en/calls/open-technology-programme-2026
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
