DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261222
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261223
SUMMARY:Full proposal deadline: Geneesmiddelen VIMP 2026-1 (Dissemination 
 & Implementation Impulse)
DESCRIPTION:ZonMw. VIMP (Verspreidings- en Implementatie-impuls) within th
 e Goed Gebruik Geneesmiddelen programme. Supports dissemination and imple
 mentation of promising results or unexpected insights from completed ZonM
 w/GGG medicines research. Opened 22 June 2026\; deadline 22 December 2026
  14:00 CET. Total round budget €250\,000\; grants typically up to ~€5
 0\,000. Dutch-based applicants only.\n\nhttps://www.zonmw.nl/nl/subsidie/
 geneesmiddelen-vimp-2026-1
URL:https://www.zonmw.nl/nl/subsidie/geneesmiddelen-vimp-2026-1
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
