DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270212
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270213
SUMMARY:Application deadline: NVKFB Proefschriftprijs (clinical pharmacolo
 gy dissertation)
DESCRIPTION:NVKFB. €1\,000 annual prize from the NVKFB board for a recen
 tly defended dissertation (at a university in the Dutch-language region) 
 describing clinical pharmacological or biopharmaceutical research of exce
 llent quality. The 2026 round closed 13 February 2026\; the next round is
  expected mid-February 2027 (submit thesis PDF to NVKFB@radboudumc.nl). C
 ore target audience for CCT / clinical pharmacology PhDs in the division.
 \n\nhttps://nvkfb.nl/wetenschap/proefschrift-prijs/
URL:https://nvkfb.nl/wetenschap/proefschrift-prijs/
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:funding-watch-159-20270212@robheerdink-collab.github.io
DTSTAMP:20261009T132154Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270212
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270213
SUMMARY:Application deadline: NVKFB TOP-Publicatieprijs (best clinical pha
 rmacology publication)
DESCRIPTION:NVKFB. €500 'educational grant' awarded annually by the NVKF
 B for the best Dutch- or English-language clinical pharmacological public
 ation by an NVKFB member. Awarded on the NVKFB's February cycle (alongsid
 e the Proefschriftprijs)\; next round expected mid-February 2027. Good re
 cognition for early-career researchers.\n\nhttps://nvkfb.nl/wetenschap/to
 p-publicatie/
URL:https://nvkfb.nl/wetenschap/top-publicatie/
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
