DTSTAMP:20261009T132154Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270315
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270316
SUMMARY:Application deadline: PRISMA Proefschrift Prijs 2026 (pharmacy pra
 ctice research)
DESCRIPTION:KNMP. Annual PRISMA Thesis Prize for dissertations defended in
  the previous 2 years at a Dutch or Belgian university\, on new insights 
 from pharmaceutical practice research implemented in community or hospita
 l pharmacy. Evaluated on degree of implementation\, translatability to ph
 armacist care\, and scientific quality. Awarded at the PRISMA symposium (
 12 May 2026\, Breukelen). Submit via prisma@knmp.nl.\n\nhttps://www.knmp.
 nl/beroepsontwikkeling/onderzoek/prisma
URL:https://www.knmp.nl/beroepsontwikkeling/onderzoek/prisma
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
