DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270401
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270402
SUMMARY:Application deadline: Jan Prins Proefschriftprijs 2026 (antibiotic
  stewardship)
DESCRIPTION:SWAB. €1\,000 prize for an innovative\, impactful PhD disser
 tation on antimicrobial resistance\, antimicrobial stewardship or antibio
 tic policy. Eligibility: defended at a Dutch university between 1 Jan 202
 5 and 1 Jan 2026. Submission closed 1 April 2026. Winner will be announce
 d at the SWAB Symposium (25 June 2026). Next round expected early 2027.\n
 \nhttps://www.knmp.nl/actueel/nieuws/proefschriften-over-antibioticabelei
 d-maken-kans-op-jan-prins-proefschriftprijs-2026
URL:https://www.knmp.nl/actueel/nieuws/proefschriften-over-antibioticabele
 id-maken-kans-op-jan-prins-proefschriftprijs-2026
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
