SUMMARY:Application deadline: ACPE 2026 Melbourne – Travel Scholarships
DESCRIPTION:ISPE / ACPE. Travel scholarships for the Asian Conference on P
 harmacoepidemiology (ACPE) 2026 in Melbourne\, Australia. Deadline 12 Jun
 e 2026. Good opportunity for early-career pharmacoepi researchers to pres
 ent and network. [2026 Melbourne scholarship round closed 12 Jun 2026\; r
 olled forward to expected next annual cycle.]\n\nhttps://www.asianpharmac
 oepi.org/scholarships/
URL:https://www.asianpharmacoepi.org/scholarships/
