DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270616
SUMMARY:Application deadline: Van Walree Fund 2026
DESCRIPTION:KNAW. Up to €10\,000 for early career researchers in medical
 \, biomedical\, or health sciences. Supports sustainable and innovative i
 nitiatives for international knowledge sharing. [2026 cycle closed 15 Jun
  2026\; rolled forward to expected June 2027 deadline.]\n\nhttps://www.kn
 aw.nl/en/funds-and-prizes
URL:https://www.knaw.nl/en/funds-and-prizes
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:funding-watch-189-20270701@robheerdink-collab.github.io
DTSTAMP:20261009T132154Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270701
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270702
SUMMARY:Nomination deadline: KNAW Early Career Award 2027
DESCRIPTION:KNAW. KNAW Early Career Award: up to 12 awards of €15\,000 e
 ach (max 3 per Academy domain) for researchers 3-7 years post-PhD who do 
 not yet hold an associate/full professor position. Recognises innovative 
 contributions to science and scientific practice. Nominations open until 
 1 July 2026. Ceremony December 2026 at Trippenhuis\, Amsterdam. Contribut
 ions may relate to Recognition & Rewards themes: research\, education\, i
 mpact\, patient care\, leadership.\n\nhttps://www.knaw.nl/en/science-fund
 s/knaw-early-career-award
URL:https://www.knaw.nl/en/science-funds/knaw-early-career-award
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:funding-watch-196-20270826@robheerdink-collab.github.io
DTSTAMP:20261009T132154Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270826
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270827
SUMMARY:Application deadline: ERC Advanced Grant 2027
DESCRIPTION:ERC. ERC Work Programme 2027 (adopted). For established resear
 ch leaders with a significant track record. Call opens 27 May 2027\; dead
 line 26 August 2027. Up to €2.5M for 5 years (plus up to €1M addition
 al\, incl. Choose Europe relocation top-up). Bottom-up: any research topi
 c. Budget ~€798M\, ~311 grants expected. Successor to the 2026 round (I
 D 25).\n\nhttps://erc.europa.eu/apply-grant/advanced-grant
URL:https://erc.europa.eu/apply-grant/advanced-grant
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
