DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270902
SUMMARY:Application deadline: Novo Nordisk Foundation – Health Research 
 Grants
DESCRIPTION:Novo Nordisk Foundation. One of Europe's largest private resea
 rch foundations. Multiple grant schemes including Challenge Programme\, C
 ollaboration Grants\, and Distinguished Investigator Awards. Strong focus
  on cardiometabolic\, diabetes\, rare disease\, and AMR research. Also fu
 nded the $60M AMR initiative with Gates/Wellcome.\n\nhttps://novonordiskf
 onden.dk/en/grants/
URL:https://novonordiskfonden.dk/en/grants/
